'''Ampharos''' (Japanese: '''デンリュウ''' ''Denryu'') is a {{ct|Lightning}} Stage 2 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Wisdom of Sea and Sky}} expansion.

